§§§ `Article 5(7) — Providing the Minister with the guidance and the report`

-- src:164 | (7) Within a reasonable time after issuing or amending guidance the Commissioner must provide to the Minister a copy of the issued or amended guidance and the report published under paragraph (6)(b).

-- The standard of promptness in 5(7) ("within a reasonable time") and in 5(8) ("as soon as practicable") states no number.  FORK F2.4: it is an input judgement (first reading, taken) or a number
-- of days counted from the event (second).  FORK F2.6: if days are counted, whether the day of the event is the first day or the day after it.
-- On the second reading the last day on which the act is in time is the event day plus the number of days (the day of the event not counted), or one day earlier (the day of the event counted).
