GIVEN interp IS AN `Interpretation of Articles 3 to 7`
      issued IS A DATE
      days IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC `Legal actor` `Act under Articles 3 to 7`
`reading B of Article 5(7): within a number of days of the issue` interp issued days MEANS
    PARTY `the Commissioner`
    MUST `provide to the Minister a copy of the issued or amended guidance and the report` `the Commissioner`
