GIVEN interp IS AN `Interpretation of Articles 3 to 7`
        @desc The readings of the ambiguous provisions of Articles 3 to 7; the fields read here are how a standard of promptness is measured and how the days of a measured period are counted
      `the date the guidance was issued or amended` IS A DATE
