             WHEN `by an input judgement that the time taken was reasonable or practicable` THEN `it was laid as soon as practicable`
             WHEN `by a number of days counted from the event`
                 THEN `Art 5(7) and 5(8) the act falls within the days counted from the event` interp `the date the Minister received the guidance and the report` laid `the number of days that counts as as soon as practicable`
